---
const marqueeText = 'You’re becoming part of a mission';
---

<section class="overflow-x-clip pt-15 pb-15 md:pt-30" aria-labelledby="our-identity-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3.75">
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-base leading-none font-bold uppercase">Our identity</p>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 xl:flex-row xl:items-start xl:justify-between xl:gap-30">
        <h2 id="our-identity-heading" class="max-w-130.25 text-3xl leading-[1.1] font-bold md:text-5xl">More Than a Name. A Mission</h2>

        <div class="flex w-full max-w-148.75 flex-col gap-10 text-foreground">
          <p class="text-base leading-none">
            The name Crew419 represents who we are and why we serve. Crew represents a community of believers working together with a shared purpose — serving alongside one another, local
            churches, and ministry partners around the world. We believe mission is not something we do alone. Together, we become part of something greater: sharing the Gospel and serving
            others.
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3.75">
            <p class="text-base leading-none">
              The number <span class="text-primary">419</span> comes from <span class="text-primary">Matthew 4:19</span>, where Jesus says:
            </p>
            <p class="font-serif text-2xl leading-[1.1] font-bold">“Follow me, and I will make you fishers of men.”</p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-base leading-none">
            This verse reminds us that every believer is called to follow Jesus and participate in His mission. Our motto, “Until the Nets Are Full,” comes from the stories of Jesus calling His
            disciples to cast their nets and trust His word. In Luke 5:4-6, Jesus tells Simon Peter to let down his nets, and they bring in such a great catch that the nets begin to break. In
            John 21:6, Jesus again fills the nets when the disciples follow His direction. These moments represent our mission: to faithfully go where God leads, share the Gospel with others,
            and continue reaching people until the nets are full. At Crew419, you’re not just joining a trip.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-15 overflow-hidden md:mt-30" data-identity-marquee>
    <div class="flex w-max gap-x-15" data-identity-marquee-track>
      <p class="font-serif text-4xl leading-[1.1] font-bold whitespace-nowrap text-foreground md:text-6xl xl:text-7xl">{marqueeText}</p>
      <p class="font-serif text-4xl leading-[1.1] font-bold whitespace-nowrap text-foreground md:text-6xl xl:text-7xl" aria-hidden="true">{marqueeText}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes about-marquee {
    from {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
    to {
      transform: translateX(calc(-50% - 1.875rem));
    }
  }

  [data-identity-marquee-track] {
    animation: about-marquee 28s linear infinite;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    [data-identity-marquee-track] {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
